Supplemental Agreements”);

‘holder’, in relation to securities,
means owner of the securities according to the manner in which ownership of
the securities is determined;

‘the Loan
Council’ means the Australian Loan Council created in
pursuance of this Agreement;

a reference to a year is, unless the contrary
intention appears, a reference to a financial year commencing on a 1st
July;

the expression ‘in writing’ includes
any mode of representing or reproducing words and figures in a written form;
